Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|portlet.plugins.includes|wsrp-portlet|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|WSRP|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add WSRP Unit Converter
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Apps
		|portlet|WSRP Admin|
	When WSRP add Producer CP
		|portletsAvailableSelect|Unit Converter|
		|producerName|Producer Demo|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Apps
		|portlet|WSRP Admin|
	And WSRP add Consumer CP
		|consumerName|Consumer Demo|
		|producerName|Producer Demo|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Apps
		|portlet|WSRP Admin|
	And WSRP add Consumer Portlet CP
		|consumerName|Consumer Demo|
		|consumerPortletName|WSRP Unit Converter|
		|consumerPortletType|Unit Converter|
	And these variables
		|key_consumerPortletName|WSRP Unit Converter|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'WSRP Unit Converter' at locator 'WSRPAdminManagePortlets#PORTLET_TABLE_NAME'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Unit Converter' at locator 'WSRPAdminManagePortlets#PORTLET_TABLE_REMOTE_PORTLET'
	And AssertElementPresent the value 'Delete' at locator 'WSRPAdminManagePortlets#PORTLET_TABLE_DELETE'
	And Page add
		|pageName|WSRP Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|WSRP Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|WSRP Unit Converter|
	Then WSRP wsrp Unit Converter Convert PG
		|initialUnit|Inch|
		|initialValue|12|
		|targetUnit|Foot|
		|targetValue|1.0|
		|unitType|Length|